  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The engagement facility provides a rapid and flexible response mechanism to support upstream policy results, evaluation and assessments, crisis responses and the testing of innovations with scale-up potential.  This project provides integrated technical, programmatic, and operational support to key Syrian government institutions to strengthen governance, service delivery, and peacebuilding outcomes. It focuses on capacity development, institutional rehabilitation, and strategic reforms across s</narrative>
